### Файл для тестирования через REST Client (VS Code расширение)
### Или используй эти примеры в Postman/Thunder Client

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@token = YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
@adminToken = ADMIN_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### ============================================
### 1. АВТОРИЗАЦИЯ
### ============================================

### Регистрация заводчика
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register/breeder
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "breeder@test.com",
  "password": "Test123456",
  "firstName": "Jan",
  "lastName": "Kowalski",
  "phone": "+48123456789",
  "breeder": {
    "kennelName": "Test Kennel",
    "kennelRegistration": "XII-1234/56",
    "region": "Mazowieckie",
    "city": "Warszawa",
    "description": "Test description",
    "breeds": []
  }
}

### Вход в систему
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "breeder@test.com",
  "password": "Test123456"
}

### ============================================
### 2. ДОКУМЕНТЫ
### ============================================

### Загрузка документа ZKwP
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="zkwp.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./test-files/zkwp.pdf
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="type"

zkwp_certificate
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### Получить мои документы
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/my
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### 3. АДМИН - МОДЕРАЦИЯ ДОКУМЕНТОВ
### ============================================

### Получить документы на модерацию
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/documents/pending
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Одобрить документ (замени DOCUMENT_ID)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/documents/DOCUMENT_ID/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ============================================
### 4. ОБЪЯВЛЕНИЯ - СОЗДАНИЕ
### ============================================

### Создать объявление (черновик)
POST {{baseUrl}}/listings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Szczenięta Golden Retriever
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="breed"

BREED_ID_HERE
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="birthDate"

2024-10-15
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="gender"

male
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="color"

Złoty
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="price"

3500
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="currency"

PLN
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="microchipNumber"

616123456789012
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="hasPedigree"

true
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="hasVetPassport"

true
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="hasMetric"

false
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="fatherName"

Champion Golden Star
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="fatherPedigreeNumber"

PKR.VIII-12345
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="fatherTitles"

["Champion Polski"]
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="motherName"

Lady Sunshine
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="motherPedigreeNumber"

PKR.VIII-54321
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

Piękne szczenięta z doskonałej linii hodowlanej. Zdrowi rodzice z tytułami championów.
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="videos"

[]
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="status"

draft
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photos"; filename="photo1.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./test-files/photo1.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photos"; filename="photo2.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./test-files/photo2.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photos"; filename="photo3.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./test-files/photo3.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="pedigreeDocument"; filename="pedigree.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./test-files/pedigree.pdf
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="vetPassportDocument"; filename="passport.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./test-files/passport.pdf
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### ============================================
### 5. ОБЪЯВЛЕНИЯ - ПОЛУЧЕНИЕ
### ============================================

### Получить мои объявления
GET {{baseUrl}}/listings/my
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Получить объявление по ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/listings/LISTING_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Публичный каталог
GET {{baseUrl}}/listings?page=1&limit=20

### Каталог с фильтрами
GET {{baseUrl}}/listings?breed=BREED_ID&region=Mazowieckie&priceMin=1000&priceMax=5000&gender=male&verified=true

### ============================================
### 6. ОБЪЯВЛЕНИЯ - УПРАВЛЕНИЕ
### ============================================

### Изменить статус объявления
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/listings/LISTING_ID_HERE/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "pending"
}

### Удалить объявление
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/listings/LISTING_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

